{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0464_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9b381754a3a3dabae1e6871cca759568bc2f4245a22b05b07382ef664584205f", "ja": "（仕事が早く終わり、麗花の提案でドライブに来た。\n休憩も兼ねて、途中で見かけた牧場に寄ることに……）", "zh": "（工作提前结束后，应丽花的提议来兜风了。顺便休息一下，决定去途中看到的那家牧场看看……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0464_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "c9cd9d9a63d349fd5c571dc556d205b67916a4ad8473ddaa2e27a9f577f28102", "ja": "{$P$}さん、牛さんがいっぱいです！\n草を食べてる子と、寝てる子ばっかり！　かわいい～！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，有好多牛牛！\n全都不是在吃草就是在睡觉！好可爱～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0464_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a7c5c76f64dca3f3bc944e7567e286d8a53cfd0009209e4ff69f98d6f51cf4d5", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。それより麗花。\nずっと運転しっぱなしだけど疲れてないか？", "zh": "啊，是啊。比起这个，丽花。\n你一直在开车，累不累？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0464_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "c43a11cee8b1f42a1c7d0938dabc99455b17a4508a5207ac06d0aa0afe5f419d", "ja": "私はへっちゃらです！　運転は大好きですし。\nあ、もしかして……牛デューサーさんになりますか？", "zh": "我完全没问题！而且我很喜欢开车。啊，难道说……您要变成牛制作人先生吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0464_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3123dc366a293f3690737ca2d7a454ee78cb29fad874b1c97d30124bdd16a765", "ja": "いや、牛にはならないよ。\nただ麗花が疲れてたなら運転を代わろうと思って。", "zh": "不，我不会变成牛。\n只是如果丽花累了，我想替她开车。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0464_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "9bddf96c1fbdc41076578078f2ef30dab7d6603f2d5efb4b5564dc9bb2281bb6", "ja": "ありがとうございまーす！　でもご心配なく！\n私、運転してて疲れたことがないんです♪", "zh": "非常感谢——！不过不用担心！\n我开车从来都不会觉得累呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0464_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "8c488a712fbd86ce220cbe85f1a47fe1a114c92998a76805c0e5e59c9973312c", "ja": "カーオーディオの代わりに、和三盆の歌を\n無限にリピートできるぐらいには元気ですよ♪", "zh": "我精神得连车载音响都能换成和三盆之歌无限循环播放了哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0464_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2ccb6426a07c3a1a306717dc140ee84663dbb5780a52b2c484f5b3f4c48406d2", "ja": "ははっ。それは豪華なドライブになりそうだ。\nところで麗花。大事なことを聞いてもいいか？", "zh": "哈哈，那肯定会变成一次豪华的兜风。\n话说回来，丽花。我可以问你一件重要的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0464_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "8a432da1fd647b2e2f4adc76a14abf43371db07a33812ebd3c1147d235da3b2d", "ja": "えっ、大事なことですか？　なんだろう～？\n冷蔵庫に入ってるケーキの賞味期限とかですか……？", "zh": "咦，很重要的事吗？会是什么呢～？\n比如冰箱里蛋糕的保质期之类的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0464_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e8431b23d141199103b2e8d056fafe21959673dc1148fa469308fd6e9ed45ba6", "ja": "ああ。それも大事だな。大事なんだけど……\nこのドライブの目的地を聞いてなかったと思うんだ。", "zh": "啊，那也很重要。确实很重要，不过……\n我好像还没问过这次开车要去哪里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0464_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "992bccdda083c1dde5a9664d191634b27dae68ebfeb55f818254064cc26d4bec", "ja": "ええ～！？　{$P$}さん、\nどこに行くか知らずに車に乗っちゃったんですか～！？", "zh": "诶诶～！？{$P$}先生，您居然连要去哪儿都不知道就上车了吗～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0464_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2b5da7d01882349a793c18522a9ce99ffd81f16d8246e0f715cad596e6e46a8c", "ja": "そ……そうだな。麗花が楽しそうだったから、\nつい聞きそびれてしまったんだ。", "zh": "嗯……是啊。因为丽花看起来很开心，我一不小心就忘了问。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0464_1012_p", "source_sha256": "dd8d788a732b2066bbf380b0e718bc2c8492fc87bc6f3bbaa372140227f9aeb3", "ja": "でももし運転を代わることがあるなら、\n目的地くらいは知っといた方がいいかと思ってね。", "zh": "不过，要是之后需要换人开车的话，我觉得至少还是知道目的地比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0464_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "822851a7a1dacfabcf90f9614b4799313f04ffc76892dcddf0a262d6297e00ea", "ja": "わかりました。それでは発表しますね。私達が向かって\nいるのは……だらだらだらだら～～～ダダンッ！", "zh": "明白了。那么我就来公布吧。我们正在前往的\n目的地是……咚啦啦啦啦啦～～～咚咚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0464_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "10111b6856d3c8d61e91ebe246894e90f67d015cded61dac08505aded1e8efa2", "ja": "日本一の星空が見られるキャンプ場でーす！\nパチパチパチパチ～♪", "zh": "这里可是能看到全日本最美星空的露营地哦——！\n啪啪啪啪～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0464_1015_p", "source_sha256": "de2c644e4e31a1559a18d99c5692de9dfa2f2d871e2efed7dc4fe6de4b7a490d", "ja": "そうだったのか。なんだか山に向かって進んでるなと\n思ったけど……。", "zh": "原来是这样。我就觉得好像一直在往山里走……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0464_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "0b11aad5e9c2270ccf7b6a3d830f2d1a939d88b173603aee26a4af36010b5945", "ja": "はい！　子供の頃に、家族と行ったことがあるんです。\nすごいんですよ。キラキラ～がぶわーって感じで！", "zh": "是的！我小时候和家人一起去过那里。\n可厉害了，感觉闪闪发光的景象一下子铺展开来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0464_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "7af14ebb57e93411a93adfdcd73ab7c4f6210cca1f5e3399f4a9cc9243af3cfe", "ja": "山間から見える星空はすごく近くに見えて……\n星を取ろうと思って、いっぱいジャンプしてました。", "zh": "群山之间看到的星空显得特别近……\n当时我总想着要把星星摘下来，不停地往上跳呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0464_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "54bfb6ee6d87bb76d888bd01be19a9f59212bff344cdb5805c57f65cf872d476", "ja": "でもでも、あの時よりググーンって成長したし、\n今なら星空も掴めちゃうかも♪", "zh": "不过不过，我已经比那时候咕咚——成长了很多，现在说不定连星空都能抓住哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0464_1019_p", "source_sha256": "9c1d413874da9a359e00638a2a3c6cadc7cb22852c29941a2dd7928ab9199a3d", "ja": "ははっ、そうだな。麗花なら掴めるかもな。\n日本一の星空か……なんだか楽しみになってきたよ！", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。要是丽花的话，说不定真的能抓住呢。\n日本第一的星空啊……不知不觉开始期待起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0464_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "20962b9b902ec0b995986b17cccecf5de75ffa52380b6fe2c9ce5a68b7d97f26", "ja": "{$P$}さんもホップデューサーさんに\nなって、一緒に星空を掴んじゃいましょう♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生也变成起跳人先生，\n一起把星空抓在手里吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0464_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "bd7e725403c067577b34f71752ebf4461e024549aea90f7600f0d0a41773d389", "ja": "ホップ・ステップ・ジャーンプって。一緒に跳んだら\n星の向こうまで跳べちゃうかもしれませんね！", "zh": "蹦、踏、跳——要是一起跳的话，说不定能跳到星星的彼岸呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0464_1022_p", "source_sha256": "a873bdae97a629baabb45705a374f1fa2d071103dc6c90780aaf7d69b3d36634", "ja": "（麗花の思い出の場所に向かってるとは思わなかったが\n……一緒に見る星空は、すごく綺麗なんだろうな）", "zh": "（没想到我们正要前往丽花记忆中的地方……不过，一起欣赏的星空一定会非常美吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
